# ============================================================================
# OlliTeX Toolkit — IMAGE VERSIONS (single source of truth)
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Edit THIS one file to upgrade or pin every container image. All compose
# fragments resolve their `image:` value from the variables defined here
# (defaults below can be overridden in a user's config/overleaf.rc).
#
# Pre-pull a change before an upgrade with:  bin/images --pull
# ============================================================================

# --- OlliTeX server ---------------------------------------------------------
# The full OlliTeX build from this repository (6.3.0-ext port + Typst + hub).
# Build locally:  cd overleaf/server-ce && make all
OLLITEX_IMAGE=sharelatex/sharelatex:ext-6.3.0-port

# --- Core services ----------------------------------------------------------
# (values validated against the compose_cep production stack, 2026-09-13)
MONGO_IMAGE=mongo:8.3
REDIS_IMAGE=redis:8.6-alpine
NGINX_IMAGE=nginx:1.30-alpine

# --- Sandboxed compiles (MANDATORY since 2026-09-16, owner #10) -------------
# TeX Live image(s) used by the sandboxed compile containers (comma separated).
# OlliTeX enforces the Docker sandbox runner — the local/in-container compile
# path and the local TeX Live install in the server image are gone.
# 2026-09-16 (owner #10): official TeX Live image as the default for fresh
# installs. The quay.io/sharelatex/texlive-full pin remains a valid
# fallback — set TEXLIVE_IMAGE to it in the compose env for the exact 2026.1
# build.
TEXLIVE_IMAGE=texlive/texlive:latest-full

# --- Typst (pinned; pre-pull target for sandboxed typst compiles) -----------
# The OlliTeX image compiles Typst with this exact digest (network disabled);
# pre-pull it once so the first compile is fast:
TYPST_IMAGE=pandoc/typst:latest-alpine@sha256:ae9dfa3c58cae72d363484442993b761ff4bc30202ec12823bc1e59fa952c892

# --- LanguageTool (optional; bin/languagetool-ngrams for language models) ---
LANGUAGE_TOOL_IMAGE=erikvl87/languagetool:latest
